   1: #!/usr/bin/env python3
   2: """Leakage-safe outer-LOCO benchmark for the two prespecified sequence models.
   3: 
   4: The script uses the corrected 20-feature mission manifest, 20-mission causal
   5: histories, deterministic sample-balanced inner cell folds, and training-only
   6: imputation/scaling.  It writes every held-out prediction and fold log so that
   7: aggregate numbers are auditable rather than manuscript-only claims.
   8: """
   9: 
